# Atlas Core Dashboard Density & Render Optimization Spec
**Author:** Prism Cross  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D16 13:00  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Design token and layout refactor to streamline dashboard information architecture, reduce DOM tree depth, and optimize rendering latency for Atlas Core.

